{"id":"prophe_tie","lemma":"prophétie","pos":"noun","rank":4605,"glosses":["prophecy"],"ipa":"/pʁɔ.fe.si/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/c/c2/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Poslovitch-proph%C3%A9tie.wav/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Poslovitch-proph%C3%A9tie.wav.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"prophéties"},"examples":[{"text":"Il avait le don de prophétie.","en":"He had the gift of prophecy.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"to have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"gift, talent, knack"},{"g":"of / from"},null]},{"text":"Elle a un don de prophétie.","en":"She has a gift for prophecy.","words":[{"g":"she / it"},{"g":"has","l":"avoir"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"gift, talent, knack"},{"g":"of / from"},null]},{"text":"Il s'intéresse aux prophéties mayas.","en":"He's interested in Mayan prophecies.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"oneself / if"},{"g":"to interest","l":"intéresser"},{"g":"to the"},null,{"g":"Mayan","l":"maya"}]},{"text":"Ta prophétie est devenue réalité.","en":"Your prophecy has come true.","words":[{"g":"your"},null,{"g":"is","l":"être"},null,{"g":"reality"}]},{"text":"La prophétie s'avéra.","en":"The prophecy came true.","words":[{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"oneself / if"},{"g":"to uncover, to reveal","l":"avérer"}]}]}